{"id":"wind-spirit-sylphis","name":{"en":"Wind Spirit Sylphis","ja":"風精・シルフェス","tc":"風精‧希爾菲斯","sc":"风精‧希尔菲斯"},"desc1":{"en":"A spirit of wind... that means it'straveled the world! I want to hear stories!","ja":"「風の精霊…ってことは、世界中を旅してる　のかな！えへへ、お話聞いてみたいなぁ…！」","tc":"「風的精靈……那會在全世界旅行嗎！　耶嘿嘿，好想問問牠喔……！」","sc":"“风的精灵……那会在全世界旅行吗！　耶嘿嘿，好想问问它哦……！”"},"desc2":{"en":"I'm sure it has a lot.","ja":"「ふふ、いろいろ聞けるといいわね！」","tc":"「呵呵，要是能問到很多東西就太好了呢！」","sc":"“呵呵，要是能问到很多东西就太好了呢！”"},"desc3":{"en":"I wonder what should we ask about first.","ja":"「うん！まずは何から聞こうかなぁ…！」","tc":"「嗯！首先要從什麼問起呢……！」","sc":"“嗯！首先要从什么问起呢……！”"},"char1":"firis","char2":"liane","char3":"firis","kind":"spirit","hp":1500,"atk":73,"defen":60,"spd":180,"level":35,"exp":1000,"cole":330,"slash":2,"impact":2,"pierce":5,"magic":2,"fire":4,"ice":2,"light":6,"ail":2,"item_set":[{"id":"broken-stone","name":{"en":"Broken Stone","ja":"砕けた石材","tc":"碎裂的石材","sc":"碎裂的石材"}},{"id":"blue-steel-stone","name":{"en":"Blue Steel Stone","ja":"蒼剛石","tc":"蒼剛石","sc":"苍刚石"}},{"id":"suspicious-liquid","name":{"en":"Suspicious Liquid","ja":"怪しい液体","tc":"可疑液體","sc":"可疑液体"}},{"id":"cinders","name":{"en":"Cinders","ja":"消し炭","tc":"軟碳","sc":"软碳"}},{"id":"griffon-feather","name":{"en":"Griffon Feather","ja":"グリフォンの羽根","tc":"獅鷹的羽毛","sc":"狮鹰的羽毛"}},{"id":"tough-bone","name":{"en":"Tough Bone","ja":"丈夫な骨","tc":"堅韌骨頭","sc":"坚韧骨头"}},{"id":"unknown-egg","name":{"en":"Unknown Egg","ja":"何かのタマゴ","tc":"不知名的蛋","sc":"不知名的蛋"}},{"id":"spirit-rock","name":{"en":"Spirit Rock","ja":"精霊石","tc":"精靈石","sc":"精灵石"}},{"id":"neutralizer-r","name":{"en":"Neutralizer R","ja":"中和剤・赤","tc":"中和劑‧紅","sc":"中和剂‧红"}},{"id":"neutralizer-b","name":{"en":"Neutralizer B","ja":"中和剤・青","tc":"中和劑‧藍","sc":"中和剂‧蓝"}},{"id":"ingot","name":{"en":"Ingot","ja":"インゴット","tc":"金屬塊","sc":"金属块"}},{"id":"cloth","name":{"en":"Cloth","ja":"クロース","tc":"布料","sc":"布料"}},{"id":"firebird-staff","name":{"en":"Firebird Staff","ja":"鳳凰の杖","tc":"鳳凰之杖","sc":"凤凰之杖"}},{"id":"gale-dagger","name":{"en":"Gale Dagger","ja":"疾風の小太刀","